### =========================================
### LingoFlow - 用户模块 API 测试脚本
### =========================================

### 1. 用户注册
# 点击左侧的绿色箭头运行。如果提示成功，说明数据已落库。
# 如果你想再测一次，记得把 username 改掉，否则会触发"用户名已存在"的拦截。
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "lingo_master1",
  "password": "password123",
  "targetLanguage": "EN",
  "currentLevel": "V2000"
}


### 2. 用户登录 (黑科技：自动保存 Token)
# 注册成功后点击运行这个。
# 运行完毕后，注意看 IDEA 底部的 Run 控制台，会打印出 "Token已成功保存"！
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "lingo_master1",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    // 这是 IDEA 的自动化脚本：从返回值中提取 Token 并存入全局变量 jwt_token 中
    if(response.status === 200 && response.body.code === 200) {
        client.global.set("jwt_token", response.body.data);
        client.log("✅ Token已成功保存到内存变量中: " + client.global.get("jwt_token"));
    }
%}


### 3. 获取个人信息 (自动携带 Token)
# 直接运行！它会自动读取上面登录接口存下来的 {{jwt_token}} 发送给后端。
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}


### 4. 附加测试：不带 Token 或带假 Token 访问 (预期被拦截)
# 预期返回："未登录或请求头格式错误" 或 "Token无效或已过期"
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/info
Authorization: Bearer faketoken123456

### 核心功能：AI 改写文章并提取生词
POST http://localhost:8080/api/article/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "difficultyLevel": "PTE 45分水平",
  "originalText": "Quantum computing is a rapidly-emerging technology that harnesses the laws of quantum mechanics to solve problems too complex for classical computers. These machines are very different from the classical computers that have been around for more than half a century. While classical computers rely on bits, which can be either 0 or 1, quantum computers use quantum bits, or qubits. Qubits can exist in a state of 0, 1, or both simultaneously, a phenomenon known as superposition."
}

### 获取历史阅读列表 (分页查询)
# 默认查第 1 页，每页 10 条
GET http://localhost:8080/api/article/list?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### 获取单篇文章详情
# 这里的 3 是你上一回合跑通生成的文章 ID，可以根据你数据库里的实际 ID 替换
GET http://localhost:8080/api/article/3
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### 1. 分页获取未掌握的生词列表
# 查你刚刚用 AI 生成出来的那些生词！
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vocabulary/list?page=1&size=10&mastered=0
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### 2. 标记某个生词为已掌握
# 这里的 1 替换成你数据库里实际的生词 ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/vocabulary/master/1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### 3. 手动添加一个生词
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vocabulary/add
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "articleId": 3,
  "word": "harness",
  "translation": "利用、控制",
  "contextSentence": "that harnesses the laws of quantum mechanics"
}

### 划词即时翻译
POST http://localhost:8080/api/article/translate
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "word": "harnesses",
  "contextSentence": "Quantum computing is a rapidly-emerging technology that harnesses the laws of quantum mechanics to solve problems."
}

### 1. 动态生成课后自测题
# 这一步 AI 会现编 3 道题给你，注意复制其中一道题和你的随便选的一个答案，留着下一步用！
POST http://localhost:8080/api/quiz/generate/3
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### 2. 提交答案，获取判题结果与名师解析
POST http://localhost:8080/api/quiz/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "articleId": 3,
  "userAnswers": [
    {
      "question": "What property of qubits makes them different from bits in traditional computers?",
      "originalOptions": [
        "A. Qubits can only be 0 or 1.",
        "B. Qubits can be 0, 1, or both at the same time.",
        "C. Qubits have been in use for over five decades.",
        "D. Qubits are more complex to understand."
      ],
      "selectedOption": "A. Qubits can only be 0 or 1."
    }
  ]
}

### 一键导出个人数据 (保存为文件)
# 注意：在 IDEA 中运行这个接口时，它会把 JSON 打印在控制台，或者提示你 Save Response
GET http://localhost:8080/api/data/export
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}